cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ppflx: privacy-preserving federated learning with HE, ZKP and DP on Flower"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mehdi
    family-names: Valinejad
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-9154-9606"
  - name: "CorpiXo"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.9.0
date-released: "2026-10-06"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CorpiXo/ppflx"
abstract: >-
  A privacy-preserving federated learning library on Flower. Each privacy
  mechanism is a plugin: homomorphic encryption (CKKS, TFHE, exponential
  ElGamal), Groth16 zero-knowledge proofs of bounded model updates, bound to
  the aggregated ciphertext in the ElGamal modes, and differential-privacy
  noise, with a per-round audit ledger.
